Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:01:02.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.93,0:01:17.77,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:22.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.19,0:01:29.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:34.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.36,0:01:38.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:41.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:47.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:51.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:54.12,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:02:00.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:03.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:06.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.07,0:02:11.86,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:17.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.83,0:22:24.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}面向未來　擁抱夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:28.41,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}下定決心　仰望天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:34.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}用我的翅膀跨越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.46,0:22:38.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}你才是我命中注定之人 !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:42.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}我宣布　絕對love !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:48.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}閃亮的季節漸漸逝去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:53.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}紀念照裡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:56.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}是那一成不變的　困惑的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:23:03.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}溫柔地　溫暖地　讓我淚水盈眶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.93,0:23:08.50,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}預感明天也能在此相見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:12.09,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}不需要約定　去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.09,0:23:16.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}像往常一樣若無其事的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.00,0:23:21.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}笑著揮動小手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.28,0:23:26.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\shad0\be1}{\fad(0,1000)}「那麼…明天見。」
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…有什麼事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值夜班的時候把我叫到這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  又上升了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children總有一天會變成\N毀滅這個世界的惡魔的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個預知會變成現實
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管理官！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前也說過了吧  這把槍…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君  你現在需要的是\N保護Children的未來的力量和覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直不敢正視是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:43.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會輸給命運的大潮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:54.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了  快沒有效果了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(830,570)\fad(500,500)}47th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(880,600)\fad(500,500)}「一場春夢！明日的回憶」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.17,0:02:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點都沒變啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然收拾的很乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道你會到這裡來  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.01,0:02:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我並不想以這個形式和你見面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見了  葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說這種話的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:06.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生為了找你而去了紐約
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.36,0:03:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我是來見葵和紫穗的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.47,0:03:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也猜到你們倆會在這裡埋伏的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為我們會跟你走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:19.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的以為我們會成為P.A.N.D.R.A的同夥  和普通人戰鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明抗ESP裝置還在起作用的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周圍全是瓦礫  這樣子沒辦法瞬移
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆都會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:37.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們從小就是好友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼好友啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你們知道我都看到了些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通人在背地裡都對超能力者做了些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能被她煽動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.03,0:03:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙已經不是以前的薰了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,證據就是她這麼長時間裡居然沒說出一個大叔笑話來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是變了  而是改正了這些不良習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.69,0:04:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果一直能像那個時候一樣的話  那是多麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.60,0:04:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  真好  新生真是可愛的不得了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒辦法想像在四五年後會擁有大人般的巨乳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是什麼大叔品味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.80,0:04:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正這傢伙從小時候起就是這副德性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我們也五年級了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也不代表有什麼會改變…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊  完全沒有成長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可憐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我趕快把這壞毛病改掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對教育不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:45.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜班結束了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋糕？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是慶祝我們升級吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？  呃…這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.97,0:04:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不覺得太樸素了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是普通的點心啊  有什麼不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,升級有什麼好專門慶祝的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慶祝一下又有什麼關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有愛啊  愛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意見這麼大的話那就還我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過明天會好好慶祝的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真纏人啊  都說了不會慶祝的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛上完夜晚  所以去睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本那傢伙算什麼意思嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呸！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  管理官也確實說的沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她們也不會一直是孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.54,0:05:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突破口是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何我都…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要保護她們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  三位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜升級
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又成長了一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總感覺跟平時有點不同
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不很明顯嗎  你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.71,0:06:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那幫傢伙圍上來要我穿成這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  我才不要裝年輕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學生服不是裝年輕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了  給我穿上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外因為其他兩位對我懷有戒心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我今天裝了大量的限制器
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的我和普通人沒有任何區別  是手無寸鐵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.61,0:06:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過為防萬一  我雇用了保鏢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:44.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是指它嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還真是個值得依靠的硬漢子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我是站在楚楚可憐的幼女這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想的話  我隨時都可以幹掉這個LOLI控
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:57.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呀  真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上把他幹掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.65,0:06:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不帶它來比較好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣  這樣就放心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我無論如何都想和你們一起慶祝你們的成長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會陪我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微觀察一下情況也是無所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:18.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要帶我們去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來  搭上來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  葵  紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好地方是…這裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是普通的遊樂園嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不喜歡嗎  難得我全包下來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.53,0:07:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  只是覺得太過普通了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯  這裡是普通的遊玩場所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問題是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.87,0:07:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們並不普通
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的設施對ESP有很多限制的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒有在這種地方玩過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽  我也想和姐姐一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要和媽媽一起留在家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽  姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要在意  這不是你的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去那裡玩的人都會被廁所裡的手給拖進去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身上的錢全都會被搶走的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.52,0:08:19.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  要從哪個開始玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說  其實我也是第一次來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要玩那個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:29.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去遊戲中心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等…等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要慌不要慌
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎  這是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:39.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還拿著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.15,0:08:43.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能還回去嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易悄悄地拿過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  不要這麼不懂得變通嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉咯轉囉  旋轉木馬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管接下來會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不講客套
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在遊樂園  B.A.B.E.L.和P.A.N.D.R.A.也握手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:02.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過和我們平常做的不是差不多嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼試試那個？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就會覺得很爽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬移影分身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼…眼睛花了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.43,0:09:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一秒敲了八到十下吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  差不多該回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生可能會擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:41.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天他還在睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真酷啊  不好玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊樂園是很好玩  不過和你在一起就…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起和你在一起  我們更喜歡待在皆本先生身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,約會的時候談別的男人不大好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:09:59.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是什麼叫法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介  我肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說來…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡現在沒有工作人員
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.78,0:10:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吃點什麼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想去哪我都會帶你們去的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.95,0:10:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:16.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個女人的弱點原來是這方面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我記得冰箱裡有皆本先生做好的晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  這樣如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  真不愧是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們馬上去做準備  你等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是吵醒家裡的人就不好了  要安靜點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.97,0:10:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  好久沒來這裡了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  我剛說了要安靜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那個加熱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.14,0:10:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  奶油濃湯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣子可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要放上去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}イカスミとかは、勘弁してよ？{\r}\N烏賊墨汁之類的就放過我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}よい子のみんな、3月は、弥生、だよ{\r}\N好孩子們  3月是彌生哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.83,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs23}彌生是日本農曆3月，\N也指公元前4世紀到公元後3世紀的彌生時代
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗬  這就是你們平常吃的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.68,0:11:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是平民化的  樸素的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為皆本先生的料理技術是很好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意見那就回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  別生氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是很有家庭的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他帶回家還是有點做的太過火了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們倆也沒怎麼反對嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是順勢…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都聽見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:48.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們境遇很相似
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:51.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒從不二子小姐那聽說嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.78,0:11:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和你們一樣大的時候也是特殊超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:11:59.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陸軍特殊超能力部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是現在的B.A.B.E.L.的前身
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是伊號爺爺的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介原來也是同伴的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過任務的內容和現在不同
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了社會為了國家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們積極了運用自己的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  為什麼事到如今說這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後來戰爭爆發
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們成為了兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我依舊相信這是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我還有同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並且信任他們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿嘿  看到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:32.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有在看嗎  不二子小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣擊墜數首位…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不二子小姐？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  我被擊中了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上回母艦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  我沒辦法瞬間移動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動力也已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我帶你回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以自己止血吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.34,0:12:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊  當時超能力者還是少數
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:13:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的力量也是有極限的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法改變世界的趨勢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭是我們輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只剩無條件投降一路了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有能用的戰力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力部隊除了你之外也全都負傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.07,0:13:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一個人也能戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少敵人的下一輪轟炸…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:22.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未來的命運是注定的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注定？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰敗  復興
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及接下來的毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡了的海豚的腦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:35.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在沖繩成功回收了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分析的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現伊九號對我們隱瞞了部分預知
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰後超能力者會不斷增加
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後你會成為他們的領導者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將世界毀滅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隊長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們創造出像你這樣的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.26,0:13:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不能被占領軍知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:13:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑的…吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類之間的戰爭已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往後的敵人——超能力者也要趁現在解決
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往後的敵人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.93,0:14:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.47,0:14:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們終究…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:31.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這下你可以連升兩級
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他同伴現在也光榮戰死…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:46.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是怪物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.97,0:14:51.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是  在那之後我有了複數的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們沒在吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.24,0:14:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是肚子餓了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽著這種事情誰還吃得下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:01.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…不是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那個人像皆本一樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介也一定會…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一發生衝突  你認為他會站在哪一邊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.91,0:15:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道我的眼鏡放哪了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣什麼也看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得是在這附近…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  你都做了些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.33,0:15:40.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本想拿給你…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:42.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:50.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  沒這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐  你那樣簡直就像是偷情的漢子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  有誰在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先…先別管這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從浴室裡傳出紫穗的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.41,0:16:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  紫穗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.57,0:16:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭小葵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.79,0:16:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒為請我吃飯一事道謝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向主夫問好  這是小費
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像這樣  我的限制器全部都能解除
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本來想趁他發現我的時候對他施加催眠
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果…如果你敢對皆本出手的話  我絕不原諒你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才乖乖地等待時機到來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過作弄作弄他是可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他和其他普通人是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從他來了之後
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的一切都改變了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:17:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們和你們的能力我都喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向我開槍的那個男人也曾說過類似的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:06.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙全是一丘之貉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒騙你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本是不一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事是不可能發生的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:16.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  真是不懂事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來光是嘴上說你是不會明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.70,0:17:21.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我退下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗎  放任我不管的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你重視的人就可能會遭遇危險哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動腳跟下劈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太嫩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動鐵槌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:46.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動殘像百烈拳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過如此嗎  成長了的你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動無敵之盾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.14,0:18:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點程度的話  是沒辦法保護你最喜歡的皆本的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:11.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵和紫穗也是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有你重視的現在的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:19.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去你會…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Scissors Wave{\r}\N念動風剪浪影
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  剛才這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將力量壓縮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是京介你教給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.66,0:18:57.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是  如果你敢對皆本出手的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.41,0:19:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成長的超過了我的預想
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.29,0:19:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介  你是故意惹她哭的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本沒這打算的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這就回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.67,0:19:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要忘了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正傷害你的人不是我  而是那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再一起玩吧  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介這…笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.87,0:19:57.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我成為你們的負責人滿一周年的日子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  你還記得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.28,0:20:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  這麼晚了你究竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才要慶祝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備用的眼鏡  在哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  就沒有什麼禮物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然稱不上是慶祝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過作為紀念…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:27.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音樂盒？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曲子是「夢幻曲」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有相框啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我們明天一起去拍照吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要明天  現在就拍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要現在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全身濕漉漉的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為  明天會怎麼樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.20,0:20:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰也無法預料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.43,0:21:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就先聽聽你怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過之後的行動你可別抱有太大的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.27,0:21:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:14.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春天是初始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.31,0:21:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,春眠不覺曉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去一下政府機關
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:23.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下午就會回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.21,0:21:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喲  能幫我交給Children嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.99,0:21:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你好像不打算慶祝她們的成長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.45,0:21:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.64,0:21:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不開槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個藏起來的危險的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.17,0:21:50.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有所自覺吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己現在有多麼的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.54,0:21:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘管掙扎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未來在一刻刻地逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.46,0:23:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我一個人看家？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在傷好前好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.46,0:23:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.77,0:23:47.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛苦吧  要和黑色幽靈戰鬥是需要你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第48話  「理力騷然！看不見的威脅」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

